Package: morar
Title: Housing Affordability Analysis for Brazil
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Vinicius", "Oike", , "viniciusoike@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fixed-rate mortgage and housing affordability calculations for
    Brazil. Implements SAC, Price and mixed amortization, effective and
    nominal rates, insurance (MIP and DFI), administrative fees, income and
    down-payment limits on property price, full amortization schedules, and
    affordability indices (HAI and price-to-income ratio). Core functions
    are vectorized so they apply to income or price distributions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/viniciusoike/morar
BugReports: https://github.com/viniciusoike/morar/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    rlang,
    tibble,
    vctrs
